            "kicker": "05",
            "title": "Immunity",
            "text": "Support your immune system, all year round.",
            "detail_label": "What’s in it",
            "detail": "Zinc 15mg + copper 1mg, D3, folate, B6, B12"
          }
        },
        "t2": {
          "type": "table",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How the 19 ingredients work together",
            "rows": "Team | Who’s on it | What happens\nThe energy team | NR, CoQ10, copper | NR becomes NAD+, the courier. CoQ10 is the relay runner that passes energy along inside the power station. Copper sits at the very last step, where the energy gets made.\nThe recycling team | Folate, B12, B6, TMG | Your cells constantly reuse one of their most important building blocks. Folate and B12 keep that recycling loop turning, TMG runs a second loop alongside it, and B6 handles the exit. We use the active forms, the ones the cell actually uses.\nThe clean-up crew | Zinc + copper | Zinc and copper build the enzyme that cleans up the exhaust from making energy. One enzyme, two metals, so we pair them.\nThe bone relay | D3 + K2 | D3 tells your cells to make a bone protein. K2 switches that protein on. D3 makes it, K2 activates it.",
            "highlight": 0,
            "note": "",
            "fold": true
          }
        }
      },
